BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_916ca01a-aaf0-35d2-a262-d2752c1f87f2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
